{"overview":"\"Everyone Avenges Themselves\". At the instigation of Louis Berger, Henry Rogers is falsely accused of having embezzled a large sum of money and sentenced to prison. As a convict in the prison quarry, he becomes good friends with the warden's son, Allan. Lille Allan believes in Henry's innocence and help him escape.","cast":[{"n":"Greta Almroth","c":"Eva","p":"/pd4epMVeinpcxh5pshk8oKWGRlM.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Josua Bengtson","c":"Daniels","p":"/tYK08uJWrpxgb0zq4apnMGQpXjy.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Albin Lavén","c":"Louis Berger","p":"/wHngRqTpmhqI3kT6XhWI6rGrkdl.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Alfred Lundberg","c":"Williams","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Konrad Tallroth","c":"Henry Rogers","p":"/a2A9cJDb0K9DhWFvvzfN1iGdGHa.jpg","q":"Q4355682"},{"n":"Ragnar Widestedt","c":"Allan","p":"/49nSoaVgrQtekR4IiH7iY8EWjLu.jpg","q":null}],"country":["Sweden"],"language":["Swedish"],"qid":"Q10406405","rel":{"SE":{"d":"1917-07-09"}},"stills":["silent-allt-hmnar-sig-aka-everyone-avenges-themselves_1.webp","silent-allt-hmnar-sig-aka-everyone-avenges-themselves_2.webp","silent-allt-hmnar-sig-aka-everyone-avenges-themselves_3.webp","silent-allt-hmnar-sig-aka-everyone-avenges-themselves_4.webp"]}